# Portable build after every change

Whenever you finish modifying LLMChat (frontend, backend, Tauri, or related scripts):

1. Rebuild so `frontend/src-tauri/target/release/llmchat.exe` is up to date (`npm run tauri -- build` from `frontend/`, with VS + Cargo env as usual).
2. If `dist-portable\llmchat.exe` (or `llmchat-backend`) is running / locked, stop those processes first, then continue.
3. Run `powershell -File scripts/make-portable.ps1` so `dist-portable/` is refreshed.
4. Tell the user the portable path is ready: `dist-portable\llmchat.exe`.

Do this by default after each change set in this project; the user should not need to ask.
